e3a9a2d32f89a877ee9780", "created_at": "2026-11-22T17:11:59.912881+00:00", "glossary_revision": "git:e2a27853a60ffaabb479bb0faf8eb1b49b7af540", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.171.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.1-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.1-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-p0-100-stacks-properties-p013", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "p0-100-stacks-properties-p013", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5025f0f81505b95703146f9d315b31c9ede8c595177b9565843265acf6741d45", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "setoids", "target_term": "集合胚"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个代数叠（algebraic stack）。考虑如下<MATH_0002>-范畴（category）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 一个对象（object）是一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，它可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable），\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个<MATH_0004>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>由一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>和一个<MATH_0007>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>组成，并且\n<STRUCT_0004> 一个<MATH_0009>-态射（morphism），其两端为<MATH_0010>，是一个<MATH_0011>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，使得<MATH_0013>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n我们将此<MATH_0014>-范畴（category）记为<MATH_0015>，以类比《空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0001>节中的记号。现在我们断言，在这个<MATH_0016>-范畴（category）中，态射（morphism）范畴（categories）<MATH_0017>都是集合胚（setoids）。具体而言，一个<MATH_0018>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0019>是一个规则，它为每个对象（object）<MATH_0020>（属于<MATH_0021>）指定一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0022>，位于<MATH_0023>的相应纤维（fibre）范畴（category）中，使得图（diagram）<MATH_0024>交换（commutes）。但由于<MATH_0025>是忠实（faithful）的（见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0002>），这意味着若<MATH_0026>存在，则它是唯一的！换言之，<MATH_0027>-范畴（category）<MATH_0028>非常接近于一个范畴（category）。具体而言，若将<MATH_0029>-态射（morphisms）替换为<MATH_0030>-态射（morphisms）的同构类（isomorphism classes），我们就得到一个范畴（category）。我们将经常进行这一替换而不再另行说明。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:b91560ef5eb767c4c0371acaa9e87d8d704520bcbe60358489be434c6e8b3f4a", "unit_id": "tag:04ZQ:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所给对象的类型；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "高阶范畴、纤维范畴及替换后所得范畴；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "所定义范畴及源范畴的对象；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "范畴定义中的各阶态射及态射范畴；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "定义对象时的可表示性条件；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "态射可由代数空间表示的性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示"}, {"context": "所引用《空间上的拓扑》章节名称中的术语；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"context": "态射范畴的复数源词形；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "态射范畴所具有的类型；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "setoids", "target_term": "集合胚"}, {"context": "规则为每个对象指定的同构；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "同构所在的纤维范畴；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"context": "规则所需满足的交换图；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"context": "所述图应满足的性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"context": "用于推出所述态射唯一性的性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"context": "引用的章节名称；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "最后进行同构类替换的态射的复数源词形；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "用以替换态射而得到范畴的等价类；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}]}
